			<div class="content" id="post-content-4141805">
									

<p>I don't think the entire tangent on funding makes very much sense here. It seems far beyond the scope of the SCP's file, regardless if it was the first domino to have kicked things off.</p>
<p>I'll admit I'd be interested in seeing a story about that (decreased funding) as its own story divorced from a random anomaly, as we don't really see a whole lot of articles with a weaker Foundation, or one dependent on government funding.</p>
<p>I'd also say that the interjection of that narrative cripples the story of the bird; the attempt at pathos at the end came off as weak because of the distraction.</p>
<p>Not bad, but not particularly well-constructed.</p>

